	<section_number>22.1-67</section_number>
	<catch_line>Expenses of superintendents</catch_line>
	<text>
		Each school board shall provide for the necessary traveling and office expenses of the division superintendent. Detailed records of all such expenses shall be kept by the division superintendent.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 22-37; 1956, c. 633; 1964, c. 428; 1966, c. 601; 1968, c. 454; 1970, c. 691; 1972, c. 581; 1980, c. 559; 1985, c. 324; 1988, c. 95.</history>
</law>
